Value ADDRESS ([^,\s]+)
Value PORT (\d+)
Value VRF (\S+)
Value Filldown GROUP (\S+)

Start
  ^RADIUS server\s+:\s+${ADDRESS}(?:\s+\(vrf\s+${VRF}\))?,\s+authentication port\s+${PORT}\b -> Record
  ^RADIUS server-group:\s+${GROUP}\s*$$ -> Group

Group
  ^\s+\d+:\s+${ADDRESS}(?:\s+\(vrf\s+${VRF}\))?,\s+authentication port\s+${PORT}\b -> Record
  ^RADIUS server-group:\s+${GROUP}\s*$$
  ^\S -> Start

# Every row is recorded explicitly: no implicit record at the end, which would emit a row holding
# only the Filldown values.
EOF
